error[MR0181]: `one` is used before it is assigned
  --> tests/ui/flow/definite_assignment.mr:16:9
   |
12 | var one: int;
   |     --- declared here without a value
...
16 | let b = one; //~ ERROR MR0181
   |         ^^^ `one` may not be assigned here
   |
   = note: a local declared without a value must be assigned on every path before it is read; a closure sees the locals assigned where it is declared

